    vulkan_vm_lane_returns_exit0_after_cuda_lane_same_process_2026-08-25, 1, "2026-11-13: fail-loud half landed: VulkanVmExecutor returned ok=true for non-timeout dispatch errors (ok: not forced_timeout); now ok=false via svmg_dispatch_error_outcome. vulkan_vm_executor_dispatch_error_spec 1/2 -> 2/2, conformance spec 2/2, on release/1.0.0 35144b7f5e9 Linux aarch64 seed af717f53d6bce3e5. backends_spec 3/4: vulkan example passes after cuda in-process; cuda example fails with index 0 of empty records. Original interference not reproduced, precondition not met; row stays open."
    vulkan_vm_lane_returns_exit0_after_cuda_lane_same_process_2026-08-25, 2, "2026-11-13: After the ok=false change landed (PR 8782), test/03_system/acceptance/gpu_backend_portability_acceptance_spec.spl on release/1.0.0 5221a5058a8, Linux aarch64 (DGX Spark GB10), Rust seed af717f53d6bce3e5: 5 examples, 4 passed, 1 failed, 1 skipped (metal). The Vulkan example passes; the CUDA example fails with array index out of bounds: index is 0 but length is 0, the same shape as in backends_spec (its o.records[0] read after a live CudaVmExecutor run returned no records). No consumer of VulkanVmExecutor went red from the change."
    vulkan_vm_lane_returns_exit0_after_cuda_lane_same_process_2026-08-25, 3, "2026-11-26 gpuvk lane, linux-aarch64 NVIDIA GB10, seed fb80903917d6d5f5: backends_spec.spl 4/4 with cuda+vulkan live in one process; vulkan-after-cuda fixture ok=true exit=3 records=1 v=9 in 7/7 valid runs (1 of 8 excluded: CUDA init failed, precondition unmet). Intermittent cuda-lane-arena-guard-init-failed (1/8) is a separate CUDA-lane defect. Stale KNOWN RED comment removed."
    vulkan_vm_lane_returns_exit0_after_cuda_lane_same_process_2026-08-25, 4, "2026-11-26 status corrected verified -> resolved-disappeared: no interference fix was identified and the host topology differs (1 integrated GPU vs 2 discrete). CUDA flake filed as cuda_lane_arena_guard_init_intermittent_failure_2026-11-26."

